Baraka is a 1992 American non-narrative documentary film directed by Ron Fricke.

6
01:12:45,000 --> 01:12:51,000
It was photographed in the 70 mm Todd-AO format, and is the first
film ever to be restored and scanned at 8K resolution.

7
01:24:52,500 --> 01:24:58,500
The film explores themes of prayer, indigenous, community, time, spirituality.
